/*
MDC Rule: Frontend View Script for Gutenberg Blocks

- Use a `view.js` file for frontend-only JavaScript logic (outside the editor).
- Register the view script in `block.json` using the `viewScript` property.
- Keep view logic minimal and focused on interactivity not possible in PHP.
- Scope all selectors and event handlers to the block's root class.
- Avoid global side effects in view scripts.
*/
